<view class="page">
  <view class="card">
    <text class="muted">举报对象</text>
    <text class="title ellipsis mt8" style="font-size:28rpx;display:block;">{{targetTitle || '该内容'}}</text>
  </view>

  <view class="card">
    <view class="block-title">举报原因</view>
    <view
      class="reason-item {{reason === item ? 'active' : ''}}"
      wx:for="{{reasons}}"
      wx:key="*this"
      data-value="{{item}}"
      bindtap="onReasonTap"
    >
      <text class="reason-text">{{item}}</text>
      <view class="radio {{reason === item ? 'on' : ''}}"></view>
    </view>
  </view>

  <view class="form-item">
    <view class="form-label">补充说明</view>
    <textarea
      class="form-textarea"
      value="{{detail}}"
      maxlength="300"
      placeholder="补充具体位置、涉及内容等，便于平台核实"
      placeholder-class="placeholder"
      bindinput="onDetailInput"
    />
  </view>

  <view class="notice">
    平台将结合举报记录与内容情况人工审核，处置结果与原因会被留存。恶意举报可能导致账号受限。
  </view>

  <view class="footer-holder"></view>
  <view class="footer-bar">
    <view class="btn btn-primary {{submitting ? 'btn-disabled' : ''}}" bindtap="onSubmit">
      {{submitting ? '提交中…' : '提交举报'}}
    </view>
  </view>
</view>
